# Where the built site looks for the Spotify readout.
#
# Committed on purpose: this is baked into the public JS bundle, so it is
# not a secret. The credentials it fronts live only in Vercel's project
# settings. Note the /api/now-playing path — the bare domain serves the
# site's HTML, which the client cannot parse as JSON.
#
# The deploy workflow will override this if the repository variable
# VITE_NOW_PLAYING_URL is set, since real environment variables win over
# .env files in Vite.
VITE_NOW_PLAYING_URL=https://twigo-portfolio.vercel.app/api/now-playing

# twigo-bot's room API — the Kowen leaderboard and Kowen finds. The bot
# serves it behind Caddy on the Oracle server (see twigo-bot's README,
# "Room API (HTTPS)"). Empty turns both features off.
VITE_BOT_API_URL=https://twigo-bot.duckdns.org
